{
    "title": "Intermountain Health UT/ID",
    "description": "My Health+ is now the Intermountain Health patient portal for Utah and Idaho. If you are an Intermountain Health patient in Utah or Idaho, this is your new personalized app that brings powerful tools from across your health experience into one place. The app makes it easier and more convenient than ever for you to manage all aspects of your health \u2013 from booking an \r\nappointment to paying a bill.\r\n\r\nThe features of Intermountain Health's patient portal are designed to take the complexity out of managing your health, so you and your family can spend time living the healthiest lives possible. Prior to signing in you can search for doctors and locations, schedule visits, pay your bill, get an estimate, and more! \r\n\r\nWhile using the app you can:\r\n - Message your providers\r\n - Manage family appointments and schedule appointments\r\n - Easily access your health record\r\n - View your test results and medication history\r\n - Pay your medical bills in one convenient location\r\n - Get cost estimates \r\n - Launch a virtual visit with your provider or get 24/7 care with Connect Care\r\n - Check your symptoms and find the best place to go for care\r\n - Get important prompts for preventative care\r\n\r\nIntermountain Health's patient portal is an expanded and improved version of My Health+. The portal is also available as a personalized web experience at myhealthplus.intermountainhealthcare.org",
    "descriptionHTML": "My Health+ is now the Intermountain Health patient portal for Utah and Idaho. If you are an Intermountain Health patient in Utah or Idaho, this is your new personalized app that brings powerful tools from across your health experience into one place. The app makes it easier and more convenient than ever for you to manage all aspects of your health \u2013 from booking an <br>appointment to paying a bill.<br><br>The features of Intermountain Health&#39;s patient portal are designed to take the complexity out of managing your health, so you and your family can spend time living the healthiest lives possible. Prior to signing in you can search for doctors and locations, schedule visits, pay your bill, get an estimate, and more! <br><br>While using the app you can:<br> - Message your providers<br> - Manage family appointments and schedule appointments<br> - Easily access your health record<br> - View your test results and medication history<br> - Pay your medical bills in one convenient location<br> - Get cost estimates <br> - Launch a virtual visit with your provider or get 24/7 care with Connect Care<br> - Check your symptoms and find the best place to go for care<br> - Get important prompts for preventative care<br><br>Intermountain Health&#39;s patient portal is an expanded and improved version of My Health+. The portal is also available as a personalized web experience at myhealthplus.intermountainhealthcare.org",
